title: Fishing Rod
text: A BENDER is a slanted mirror. Turned one way it bends the beam by 45 degrees, from straight to diagonal or back; turned another way it throws the beam sharply back at 135 degrees. Cast the line from the tip of the rod.
trick: bender: 45 degree turn, then a sharp 135 degree turn
motif: fishing rod and line
